	quest.128AF83728356D60.quest_desc: [
		"&aWelcome, explorer! &f🚀"
		"&aStellaris transforms Minecraft into a universe full of &9planets, &dmoons &aand &bgalaxies."
		"&fCraft rockets, explore alien worlds, gather rare resources, and face cosmic challenges."
		"&dYour space journey begins now—prepare for launch! &f🚀🌌"
