	quest.28074A1033B6FFAC.title: "&9&lCraft Cables"
	quest.2B17A71A67B4BE5F.quest_desc: [
		"&fThe Water Pump is the first step toward creating &aoxygen &fand other vital resources."
		"&aPlace it above an infinite water source &fto ensure continuous supply."
		"&bConnect it with cables to a power source, and soon you’ll have the fluids needed for space survival."
		"&dCraft your first Water Pump and bring your machinery to life!"
