		"&fAfter that, you can craft the full &aPumpjack&f."
		""
		"&c&lWARNING:&r &fOnce you place the Pumpjack, you will not be able to retrieve the Pumpjack Drill."
		"&aMake sure to place it in a good location!"
		""
		"&bWhen powered, the Pumpjack will continuously drain oil from the chunk."
		"&fYou can then collect the oil using buckets, which will later be refined into fuel for your rockets."
		"&dCraft your Pumpjack and secure the fuel source for your space journey!"
