	quest.58F63AEBB7F5241A.title: "&3&lCraft a Water Separator"
	quest.5960A0A84D0D98B2.quest_desc: [
		"&fOxygen is vital once you leave the safety of the Overworld."
		"&aUse your Water Separator to produce oxygen &fand transfer it into a tank."
		"&bA filled Oxygen Tank will keep you alive on planets and moons without breathable air."
		"&dPrepare yourself—space is unforgiving without oxygen!"
