	quest.59B708FFC4F036F5.quest_desc: [
		"&fWith the rare &5Neptunium Pieces &fmined from Venus, you can now forge them into a powerful ingot."
		"&aSmelt the pieces in a furnace or blast furnace &fto refine them into a single Neptunium Ingot."
		"&bThis material is vital for advanced machines, armor, and rocket upgrades."
		"&dCraft your first Neptunium Ingot and unlock the true power of Venus! ☢️⚒️"
	]
