		"&aPlace your Rocket on top of it, fuel it with your refined oil, &fand prepare to ignite."
		"&bThe countdown will begin—once it hits zero, you’ll leave Earth behind."
		"&dPrepare for liftoff and take your first step into the cosmos! 🌌"
